    "title": "Kershaw County Launches Online Building Permit Tracker - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago Kershaw County residents now have a new online tool to track building permit availability and growth throughout the county. The Planning and Zoning Department has launched a dedicated webpage featuring an interactive ArcGIS Building Permit Allotment Tracker as part of the county’s Building Permit Allocation System, which took effect May 13th. Read full article",
